OL,3,AOne killed in sword attack at Swedish
OL,4,Aschool
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne person has been killed in a sword
OL,7,Fattack at a high school in Sweden,
OL,8,Fauthorities have said.
OL,10,FPolice were called to the Brinell
OL,11,FSchool in Fagersta shortly after 14:00
OL,12,Flocal time (13:00 BST) on Friday, where
OL,13,Fofficers arrested an 18-year-old man.
OL,15,FIn an update on Friday, police said
OL,16,Fofficers fired at the suspect before
OL,17,Farresting and detaining him.
OL,19,FTwo other people were injured in the
OL,20,Fattack, one seriously, with Swedish
OL,21,Fpublic broadcast SVT saying the other
OL,22,Fperson has "light" injuries.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
